Design a 8-to-1 multiplexer that selects one of eight 32-bit wide input data signals (data_0 to data_7) based on a 3-bit selection input (condition). The output (data_out) corresponds to the selected input based on the value of condition, where each condition value from 0 to 7 maps directly to one of the inputs.
